{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Understanding</b> — Let him use his understanding to do good. Understanding gives favor in the eyes of HaShem, and those who see him." "<b>But the way of traitors is rugged</b> — And their way is strong, so that the discerning cannot turn them back from the way of betrayal by his understanding."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:31.197039874Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}